@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FBFDFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classFontSize 15
skinparam classAttributeFontSize 12
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 36
skinparam ArrowColor #17324D
skinparam ClassBorderColor #24739B
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #E9F4FB
skinparam InterfaceBorderColor #735A9B
skinparam InterfaceBackgroundColor #F0EDFA
hide empty members

title Паттерн State: жизненный цикл выдачи

class Loan {
  +state: LoanState
}
interface LoanState {
  +status: String
}
class Active
class Overdue
class Returned {
  +returnedAt: Long
}

Loan --> LoanState : owns
LoanState <|.. Active
LoanState <|.. Overdue
LoanState <|.. Returned
Active --> Overdue : dueAt < now / refreshOverdue
Active --> Returned : returnAt(timestamp)
Overdue --> Returned : returnAt(timestamp)
Returned ..> Returned : повторный возврат запрещён
note bottom
  Active — исходное состояние.
  Overdue — persisted status после обновления срока.
  Returned — терминальное состояние с returnedAt.
end note
@enduml
